     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>On Monday, 4 May 2020 17:53:28 UTC-3, Chris Nottingham  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ZZ</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> Z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">row</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">U</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">row</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span></div></code></div><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0);font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></div><div><font face=\"monospace\" color=\"#880000\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">Why are you casting Z to a matrix, it already is a matrix?</span></font></div></div></blockquote></div>"
